## 1. Project Overview

Cravefolio is a restaurant rewards tracking website designed to help customers organize restaurant loyalty rewards, points, coupons, promotional offers, and expiration dates in one convenient location.

The initial development strategy is to use forwarded restaurant reward emails as the primary source of reward information.

### Long-term vision

- Automatically recognize restaurant reward emails.
- Extract reward descriptions, points, and expiration dates.
- Organize rewards by restaurant.
- Give each customer a personalized rewards dashboard.
- Eventually support more automated reward discovery and tracking.

The current priority is building a reliable email-based foundation before expanding automation.

