## 10. Reward Display and Accuracy Rules

Cravefolio is an independent tracking tool.

It is not affiliated with the restaurants whose rewards it displays.

The website must not claim:

- That it directly connects to restaurant loyalty accounts.
- That points balances are verified live balances.
- That rewards are guaranteed to be redeemable.
- That expiration dates exist when the source email did not provide them.
- That an unverified redemption link is official.

Display the latest saved information and clearly communicate that customers should verify balances, eligibility, expiration dates, and redemption conditions with the restaurant.

Points shown by Cravefolio should be described as the latest recorded information, not a verified live balance.

